{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Require food businesses to state on packaging if products may contain gluten",
        "additional_details": "Companies and businesses currently do not need to say on the products packaging if the product may contain gluten. This has led to a huge amount of coeliacs being given gluten by mistake, including me, which has severe effects. I want every company/business to have to state on their packaging if the product may contain gluten.",
        "background": "I want it to be required by law for any food business to label on packaging if a product may contain gluten. This is not currently required and has affected me many times as a coeliac. Clear gluten risk labelling should be mandatory.",
